  "contentHtml": "\n                      <div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">金村ブログ更新のお時間ですよ〜</span><span class=\"s2\">🔔</span><span class=\"s3\">*</span><span class=\"s1\">゜</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-08-21/30599_0.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8027.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">こんにちは！日向坂</span><span class=\"s3\">46&nbsp; </span><span class=\"s1\">金村美玖です</span><span class=\"s2\">🍨</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">まず初めにお知らせです</span><span class=\"s2\">📢</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">本日</span><span class=\"s4\">8/21</span><span class=\"s1\">から日向坂</span><span class=\"s3\">46</span><span class=\"s1\">の</span><span class=\"s5\">3rd</span><span class=\"s6\">シングル個別握手会の受付</span><span class=\"s1\">が開始されます〜！わ〜い！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">第１次応募受付は</span><span class=\"s4\">2019</span><span class=\"s7\">年</span><span class=\"s4\">8</span><span class=\"s7\">月</span><span class=\"s4\">21</span><span class=\"s7\">日（水）</span><span class=\"s4\">14</span><span class=\"s7\">：</span><span class=\"s4\">00 </span><span class=\"s7\">～</span><span class=\"s4\">8</span><span class=\"s7\">月</span><span class=\"s4\">22</span><span class=\"s7\">日（木）</span><span class=\"s4\">14</span><span class=\"s7\">：</span><span class=\"s4\">00</span><span class=\"s3\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">までとなっておりますのでお間違えのないようご確認下さいませ！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">各会場と日時はこちらです</span><span class=\"s8\">☀️</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">①</span><span class=\"s3\">2019</span><span class=\"s1\">年</span><span class=\"s3\">11</span><span class=\"s1\">月</span><span class=\"s3\">24</span><span class=\"s1\">日（日）神奈川：パシフィコ横浜</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">②</span><span class=\"s3\">2020</span><span class=\"s1\">年</span><span class=\"s3\">1</span><span class=\"s1\">月</span><span class=\"s3\">18</span><span class=\"s1\">日（土）愛知：ポートメッセなごや</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">③</span><span class=\"s3\">2020</span><span class=\"s1\">年</span><span class=\"s3\">1</span><span class=\"s1\">月</span><span class=\"s3\">19</span><span class=\"s1\">日（日）京都：京都パルスプラザ</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">④</span><span class=\"s3\">2020</span><span class=\"s1\">年</span><span class=\"s3\">2</span><span class=\"s1\">月</span><span class=\"s3\">2</span><span class=\"s1\">日（日）東京：東京ビッグサイト</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">⑤</span><span class=\"s3\">2020</span><span class=\"s1\">年</span><span class=\"s3\">2</span><span class=\"s1\">月</span><span class=\"s3\">22</span><span class=\"s1\">日（土）東京：東京ビッグサイト</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">⑥</span><span class=\"s3\">2020</span><span class=\"s1\">年</span><span class=\"s3\">2</span><span class=\"s1\">月</span><span class=\"s3\">24</span><span class=\"s1\">日（月・祝）神奈川：パシフィコ横浜</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">わー！冬ですね！冬のお洋服だとケーブルニットが大好きなのでたくさん着たいなと思っています</span><span class=\"s2\">❄</span><span class=\"s3\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">今日ちょうど話していたのですが埼玉</span><span class=\"s3\">3</span><span class=\"s1\">人でくまさんのもこもこコーデをどこかでするかも知れません！森のくまさんカフェ！</span><span class=\"s2\">🧸</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">あとは去年は</span><span class=\"s3\">1</span><span class=\"s1\">月に握手会がなくて出来なかった巫女さんにチャレンジしたいですね</span><span class=\"s2\">⛩</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">その前にクリスマスもあるんだった</span><span class=\"s3\">…</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">とにかく色々ワクワクな冬の握手会です。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">皆さんとお話できること金村も楽しみに待っております！是非気になる方は下の</span><span class=\"s3\">URL</span><span class=\"s1\">からご応募よろしくお願いします♪</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p5\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><a href=\"https://fortunemusic.jp/\">https://fortunemusic.jp/</a></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">以上、お知らせでした！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p6\"><span class=\"s9\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ここからは前回のブログ後半戦になります！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">それでは続きもお楽しみ下さい〜</span><span class=\"s10\">✧</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">【</span><span class=\"s3\">3</span><span class=\"s1\">部】</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\">○</span><span class=\"s1\">服装</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-08-21/30599_1.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8020.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\">3</span><span class=\"s1\">部からはがらっと雰囲気を変えて</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">紺色セットアップで大人っぽくしました！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">レースが上品な感じなのでパーティードレスみたいな感じですね。フォーマル。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">この夏は割とノースリーブたくさん着てるんですよ〜ハマリ中です◎</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\">○</span><span class=\"s1\">髪型</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-08-21/30599_2.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7863.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">まとめ髪にしたいです！とメイクさんにお願いしたところ、すごく複雑でお洒落なアレンジにして下さりました</span><span class=\"s2\">✨</span><span class=\"s3\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">パールアクセで華やかにしてます！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">【</span><span class=\"s3\">4</span><span class=\"s1\">部】</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\">○</span><span class=\"s1\">髪型</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-08-21/30599_3.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8021.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ちょっと違いが分かりづらいかも知れないのですが、横にまとめるアレンジにしました！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">横から見えるとボリューム感が出てよりパーティー感が増しますね〜</span><span class=\"s2\">🥳</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">以上握手会の服装</span><span class=\"s3\">&amp;</span><span class=\"s1\">髪型紹介でした！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">【お花】</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-08-21/30599_4.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8015.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ピンク色のお花！とても可愛らしいです！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ひまわりの花束！元気いっぱいだ〜！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ひまわりのお花です！お日様みたいです！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-08-21/30599_5.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8014.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">お洒落な箱に入っているお花！大人！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">黄色いリボンのお花！夏は黄色ですね！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ひまわりのお花！沢山ひまわりで嬉しい！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">白色のお花！爽やかで涼しげです！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-08-21/30599_6.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8016.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">バルーンのお花！ハートに腕通してみたよ！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">黄色づくしのお花！太陽の光みたいだ〜！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">納豆巻きコンビに！嬉しい！このみく！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">あかみく宛に！</span><span class=\"s3\">JOYFUL</span><span class=\"s1\">私達も大好きです！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">いつも沢山のお花達をありがとうございます</span><span class=\"s2\">😌</span><span class=\"s3\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">休憩中とかにじっくり見させて頂いております！とても嬉しい気持ちになる〜！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p6\"><span class=\"s9\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-08-21/30599_7.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8024.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">今回はここまで。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">次回の握手会は</span><span class=\"s3\">8/24</span><span class=\"s1\">です！また準備しなければ！来て下さる皆様よろしくお